<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Ahmsa share split due on Oct 16.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Ahmsa share split due on Oct 16.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican steel giant Altos Hornos de Mexico (Ahmsa) will carry out its previously-announced share split on October 16 offering 2.5 shares for every one in circulation, Ahmsa said Friday.</p>
<p>The share split was approved recently at the company's general meeting, although the date of the split was not then fixed. Ahmsa said the share capital of the Monclova-based company would be represented by 388,375,502 shares.</p>
<p>-- Daniel Perez-Whitaker, Monterrey bureau (528) 3457617</p>
